{
  "description": "Items (protocol/17-items.md, kinds 37303 and 37308). `reading`: what a reader takes from one event (`parseItem`), or null where it isn't an item. A reader checks the signature besides, and checks every file against the hash it is named with before using it. `bag.reading`: the items read from a bag (`bagIn`). `bag.changing`: what `changeBag` gives its owner to sign, from the newest bag found and one change, or null where there is nothing to sign. `play.said`: what each thing said in a room is read as (`parseShot`, `parseHit`, `parseDid`, `parseState`), null where it isn't one. `play.arc`: where a thing is `t` seconds after it was sent out (`shotAt`). `play.asks`: what a script's ask is taken as (`cleanAsk`), or null. `play.health`: what is left after a thing takes `by` (`struck`).",
